      (GST 0x7fbb4 x1 t0 t1 t2 x9 a0 a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7 (Z_to_bv 64 P1) (Z_to_bv 64 (zlength (rd_content st))) (Z_to_bv 64 fd) (Z_to_bv 64 (rd_cap st)) (Z_to_bv 64 ASTAGE) (Z_to_bv 64 A) t3 t4 t5 t6 F fc mm).
